      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I second this suggestion, its painful to get into public lobbies if you have a bunch of people there who look at your username and are like \"Oh, you dont sound feminine\" and then go on a rant about how you shouldnt have a feminine name and not have taken voice lessons yet.\n\nI think a lot of users, especially trans folks, would absolutely love such a system that you can hide certain aspects of your profile from strangers as it will make them feel more safe using vrc",
